    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Situated amidst the stunning waterscape of Shepperton Lakes, an area acclaimed for its Outstanding Natural Beauty, Lake Valley House is more than a home—it's a sanctuary on a sprawling 2.5-acre estate. Nestled within this enchanting landscape, the property boasts a picturesque lake teeming with diverse wildlife, offering a serene and private oasis for nature lovers and tranquility seekers alike.\r\n\r\nLocated just 3 km from the historic market town of Skibbereen, residents enjoy easy access to an array of amenities, including supermarkets, eclectic shops, delightful restaurants, lively pubs, and well-regarded primary and secondary schools. With a daily bus service to Cork City and a driving time of just 1 hour and 20 minutes, this extraordinary property beautifully combines rural peace with urban convenience.\r\n\r\n**Introduction to Lake Valley House**\r\n\r\nWelcome to Lake Valley House—a sophisticated 4-bedroom, 4-bathroom luxury residence that transcends the ordinary to offer a lifestyle deeply immersed in nature's splendor. Designed to make the most of its exquisite surroundings, the property features farmland with both level and gently sloping grasslands, presenting excellent potential for customization to your tastes.\r\n\r\nThe thoughtfully designed floorplans reveal a welcoming ground floor accented by lake views. Imagine dining with a view in the elegant dining room, or soaking up the sunshine in the adjacent sunroom. The fully fitted kitchen and cozy breakfast room flow seamlessly into a practical utility room. Completing the ground floor is a sumptuous bedroom with an ensuite, which opens out to a large, airy wet room overlooking the tranquil rear gardens.\r\n\r\nUpstairs, discover three spacious double bedrooms, two boasting ensuites, as well as a well-appointed family bathroom, providing ample accommodation for family and guests.\r\n\r\n**Garden and Grounds**\r\n\r\nThe magic of Lake Valley House extends beyond its walls with remarkable grounds that envelop the house, offering panoramic views of the shimmering lake. A sweeping drive gracefully curves around the property, enhancing the sense of arrival and encapsulating the tranquil allure of waterside living. Whether you're strolling through the scenic gardens or simply relaxing by the water's edge, Lake Valley House invites you to experience peace and luxury intertwined with nature's finest offerings.\r\n\r\nGeneral Disclaimer / Important Notice\r\nThese particulars are issued by Irish Rural Homes for guidance purposes only and do not form part of any contract. While every effort has been made to ensure accuracy, all descriptions, measurements, floor plans, boundaries, photographs, services, planning information and other details are approximate and should not be relied upon as statements of fact.\r\nInterested parties should satisfy themselves fully as to the condition, title, boundaries, planning status, services, fixtures, fittings and all other matters relating to the property prior to entering into any contract. The property, lands and any outbuildings are offered as seen, and no warranty is given by the vendor or selling agent in relation to their condition, suitability, use or future development potential.\r\nViewing is strictly by appointment only. No unauthorised access is permitted to the dwelling, lands or farm buildings. Please contact Irish Rural Homes using the contact details provided in this listing to arrange a suitable viewing time."
      },
